,"officialText":"À l'apparition, donne Vitesse augmentée à soi et aux alliés wakandiens.\n\nÀ chaque tour, rend à l'allié ayant perdu le plus de vie 10 % de la vie max. de ce personnage. Avec Chargé, rend au second allié ayant perdu le plus de vie 10 % de la vie max. de ce personnage et retire 1 fois Chargé.\n\nAu gain de Défense augmentée, génère de l'énergie de capacité pour soi.\n\nDonne +40 % de vie max.\nApplique aux alliés wakandiens +40 % de vie max.\nDonne +20 % d'armure.\nApplique aux alliés wakandiens +20 % d'armure.\n\nQuand soi ou un allié passe sous 50 % de vie, lui applique 3 fois Déviation.","operations":[{"abilityId":"abl_4b9b7acc72656f3b","abilityType":"passive","actionOrder":0,"chance":100,"characterId":"Shuri","conditions":[],"effect":{"label":"Vitesse augmentée","mechanicId":"speed-up","resolved":true,"sourceName":"SpeedUp"},"evidence":"normalized","id":"op_05707b7679744936","kind":"effect_apply","kindLabel":"Applique","mechanicIds":["speed-up"],"metrics":[{"key":"chancePct","label":"Chance","unit":"%","value":100}],"modes":[],"scope":"Cible de l’action","sides":[],"sourceType":"proc","target":"allié · cible aléatoire · jusqu’à 10","trigger":"Au début du combat"},{"abilityId":"abl_4b9b7acc72656f3b","abilityType":"passive","actionOrder":0,"chance":null,"characterId":"Shuri","conditions":[],"effect":{"label":"Déviation","mechanicId":"deflect","resolved":true,"sourceName":"Deflect"},"evidence":"normalized","id":"op_b231470ce65d35d0","kind":"effect_apply","kindLabel":"Applique","mechanicIds":["deflect"],"metrics":[{"key":"useCount","label":"Quantité indiquée","unit":null,"value":3}],"modes":[],"scope":"Cible de l’action","sides":[],"sourceType":"proc","target":null,"trigger":"Sous un seuil de vie"},{"abilityId":"abl_4b9b7acc72656f3b","abilityType":"passive","actionOrder":2,"chance":null,"characterId":"Shuri","conditions":[],"effect":{"label":"Chargé","mechanicId":"charged","resolved":true,"sourceName":"Charged"},"evidence":"normalized","id":"op_df485